sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Agent
    participant R as Router (§4.1)
    participant C7 as context7
    participant GH as github
    participant SH as shell
    participant FS as filesystem
    participant WEB as search+fetch
    participant ST as stop-gate hook

    A->>R: need pinned docs for <lib@ver>
    R->>C7: resolve-library-id → get-library-docs
    alt found
        C7-->>A: docs excerpt + URL
    else empty
        R->>WEB: fetch official docs URL
        WEB-->>A: docs + version check
    end

    A->>R: need repo state
    R->>GH: get_file_contents / list_issues
    GH-->>A: files + issues
    A->>R: need to run tests
    R->>SH: run_command(pytest -q)
    SH-->>A: output

    A->>R: need to edit
    R->>FS: read_file → edit → write_file
    FS-->>A: ok

    Note over A,ST: Before Stop, hook fires
    A->>ST: Stop
    ST-->>A: gate pass/fail (§1.3, §1.5, §6.7)